I found a more serious restart defect. The core saves credentials owned by the setup draft, but `FileStore` validates credential owners only against committed tenants. Relaunching after saving a draft credential would therefore mark the local state corrupt before draft cleanup runs. The passing restart test uses an in-memory store that skips this validation.
